                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="profile-name">Krishnendu Mitra</h3>
                    <div class="profile-role">Student Developer &amp; Lead AI System Architect</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="profile-tag">Primary Contributor</span>
              </div>
              <p class="profile-bio" style="margin-top: 16px;">
                Conceived and engineered the complete end-to-end FundusGuard platform, from mathematical model
                derivation of the SPI-OWL dual-attention mechanism to web client engineering, Docker containerization,
                and ONNX/TensorRT edge optimization pipelines.
              </p>
              <div class="profile-competencies" style="margin-top: 16px;">
                <span class="competency-label">Core Competencies &amp; Research Focus:</span>
                <div class="chips-group">
                  <span class="chip">Vision Transformers (ViT)</span>
                  <span class="chip">Biomedical Image Segmentation</span>
                  <span class="chip">TensorRT &amp; CUDA Acceleration</span>
                  <span class="chip">Explainable AI (Grad-CAM++)</span>
                  <span class="chip">Full-Stack Medical UI/UX</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="profile-footer">
              <div class="social-links">
                <a class="social-btn" href="https://github.com/kidKrishkode/" title="GitHub Source Repository">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 20px;">code</span>
